Revision history for {{$dist->name}}

{{$NEXT}}

    - Node liveness: the dashboard's live/dead split and /monitoring's
      fresh/stale classification are now made server-side against the server's
      clock, using a single window (dashboard.live_window_ms, default 15000 ms
      = 15 s). The legacy threshold was 15 minutes (dashboard) / 60 seconds
      (/monitoring); both are now 15 s by default. GET /nodes returns a per-node
      `live` boolean. (M2/M3/M4/M6)
    - POST /queues and POST /queues/:id now accept `threads: null` (the UI's
      "unlimited" value) instead of 400ing. (bug #3)
    - GET /tasks/:id no longer 500s when a caller supplies ?.limit (or other
      non-whitelisted dot-options); only .full/.terse/.epoch/.pretty are honored.
      (bug #4)
    - GET / is now served with Cache-Control: no-cache (index.html references
      un-hashed JS bundles). (A1)
    - Roboto and Material Icons are now vendored locally (via @fontsource) and
      bundled into htdocs/, instead of fetched from fonts.googleapis.com on
      every pageload. The UI no longer beacons Google and renders correctly on
      air-gapped/egress-filtered networks. (#6)
    - Subpath mounting behind an x-prepend header is no longer supported; the
      real deployment is a root proxy. main.tt was reduced to a minimal wrapper.
      (B2/#7)

